im detail</span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/locations-served/spartanburg/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/suburb-home.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/suburb-home-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/suburb-home.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:960px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cb"><h2>Spartanburg</h2><p>Spartanburg County · Upstate</p><span class="go">Local claim detail</span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/locations-served/mount-pleasant/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/harbor-bridge.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/harbor-bridge-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/harbor-bridge.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:960px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cb"><h2>Mount Pleasant</h2><p>Charleston County · Lowcountry</p><span class="go">Local claim detail</span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/locations-served/summerville/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/live-oak.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/live-oak-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/live-oak.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:960px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cb"><h2>Summerville</h2><p>Dorchester, Berkeley &amp; Charleston Counties · Lowcountry</p><span class="go">Local claim detail</span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/locations-served/rock-hill/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/modern-home.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/modern-home-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/modern-home.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:960px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cb"><h2>Rock Hill</h2><p>York County · Upstate</p><span class="go">Local claim detail</span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/locations-served/hilton-head-island/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/hilton-head.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/hilton-head-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/hilton-head.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:960px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cb"><h2>Hilton Head Island</h2><p>Beaufort County · Lowcountry</p><span class="go">Local claim detail</span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/locations-served/florence/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/river-flood.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/river-flood-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/river-flood.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:960px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cb"><h2>Florence</h2><p>Florence County · Pee Dee</p><span class="go">Local claim detail</span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/locations-served/beaufort/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/beaufort.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/beaufort-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/beaufort.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:960px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cb"><h2>Beaufort</h2><p>Beaufort County · Lowcountry</p><span class="go">Local claim detail</span></span></a><a class="card rv" href="/locations-served/aiken/"><span class="ph"><img src="/assets/img/photos/ice-storm.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/ice-storm-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/ice-storm.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, (max-width:960px) 50vw, 380px" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></span><span class="cb"><h2>Aiken</h2><p>Aiken County · Midlands</p><span class="go">Local claim detail</span></span></a></div></div></section>
<section class="sec sand"><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><p class="kicker">Regions</p><h2>How claims differ by region</h2><p>The same policy language plays out very differently on a Mount Pleasant marsh lot, a Columbia bungalow street and a Spartanburg mill village.</p></div><div class="mosaic"><div class="region rv"><img src="/assets/img/photos/charleston-houses.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/charleston-houses-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/charleston-houses.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 50vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><h3>Lowcountry</h3><p>Charleston · Beaufort · Hilton Head — Hugo, Matthew, Irma and Ian all left their mark here. Elevated homes, single houses with piazzas and wind-pool policies make for layered claims.</p></div><div class="region rv"><img src="/assets/img/photos/storm-clouds.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/storm-clouds-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/storm-clouds.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 50vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><h3>Upstate</h3><p>Greenville · Spartanburg · Anderson — Helene in 2024 showed how far inland a hurricane can reach. Spring hail and winter ice keep roofers busy across the foothills.</p></div><div class="region rv"><img src="/assets/img/photos/flood-street.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/flood-street-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/flood-street.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 50vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><h3>Midlands</h3><p>Columbia · Lexington · Aiken — The 2015 flood and the 2014 ice storm are still the reference points for water and tree claims around the capital and Aiken County.</p></div><div class="region rv"><img src="/assets/img/photos/myrtle-beach.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/myrtle-beach-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/myrtle-beach.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 50vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><h3>Grand Strand</h3><p>Myrtle Beach · Conway · Georgetown — High-rise condos, vacation rentals and Florence-era river flooding put master policies and flood coverage at the center of disputes.</p></div><div class="region rv"><img src="/assets/img/photos/river-flood.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/river-flood-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/river-flood.webp 1200w" sizes="(max-width:640px) 100vw, 50vw" width="1200" height="800" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"><h3>Pee Dee</h3><p>Florence · Darlington · Dillon — Rivers rise for days after a coastal storm. Homes, farm outbuildings and small commercial buildings often share one claim.</p></div></div></div></section>
